{"id":"14232d0aca822d75","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-low2-uniform-characterization.md","title":"Low₂ 与统一下锥性质的等价","display":"thm-low2-uniform-characterization — Low₂ 与统一下锥性质的等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-low2-uniform-characterization","aliases":["20-thm-low2-uniform-characterization"],"display":"thm-low2-uniform-characterization — Low₂ 与统一下锥性质的等价","chapter":"4","section":"4.9","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Proposition 4.9.4（以相对 Ext 完全性补足反向）","source_printed_pages":[103],"source_pdf_pages":[139],"depends_on":["[[20-df-low2-uniform-property]]","[[20-thm-low2-uniform-functions]]","[[20-thm-ext-complexity]]","[[20-thm-relative-tot-complete]]","[[20-thm-rel-post]]","[[20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-low2-uniform-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-low2-uniform-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-low2-uniform-characterization — Low₂ 与统一下锥性质的等价"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.9"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Proposition 4.9.4（以相对 Ext 完全性补足反向）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>103</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>139</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd644b6a31616fc0\" href=\"?note=bd644b6a31616fc0\" title=\"20-df-low2-uniform-property\">20-df-low2-uniform-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"47dda3af2234de34\" href=\"?note=47dda3af2234de34\" title=\"20-thm-low2-uniform-functions\">20-thm-low2-uniform-functions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1028296e1af7c37c\" href=\"?note=1028296e1af7c37c\" title=\"20-thm-ext-complexity\">20-thm-ext-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c8c6546a7f5a867\" href=\"?note=3c8c6546a7f5a867\" title=\"20-thm-relative-tot-complete\">20-thm-relative-tot-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7315f2111b653872\" href=\"?note=7315f2111b653872\" title=\"20-thm-rel-post\">20-thm-rel-post</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9aaf109dea18156\" href=\"?note=d9aaf109dea18156\" title=\"20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal\">20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bd644b6a31616fc0\" href=\"?note=bd644b6a31616fc0\" title=\"20-df-low2-uniform-property\">20-df-low2-uniform-property</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"47dda3af2234de34\" href=\"?note=47dda3af2234de34\" title=\"20-thm-low2-uniform-functions\">20-thm-low2-uniform-functions</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1028296e1af7c37c\" href=\"?note=1028296e1af7c37c\" title=\"20-thm-ext-complexity\">20-thm-ext-complexity</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3c8c6546a7f5a867\" href=\"?note=3c8c6546a7f5a867\" title=\"20-thm-relative-tot-complete\">20-thm-relative-tot-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"7315f2111b653872\" href=\"?note=7315f2111b653872\" title=\"20-thm-rel-post\">20-thm-rel-post</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d9aaf109dea18156\" href=\"?note=d9aaf109dea18156\" title=\"20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal\">20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low2-uniform-characterization}\\vdash\nU(A)\\Longleftrightarrow[A\\le_T\\varnothing\\prime\\land\\operatorname{Low}_2(A)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low2-uniform-characterization}\\vdash\nU(A)\\Longleftrightarrow[A\\le_T\\varnothing\\prime\\land\\operatorname{Low}_2(A)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>右推左：把全函数统一矩阵逐项截成二值，恰好覆盖所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算二值函数。左推右：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> 是某一行，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T0\\prime\">\\(A\\le_T0\\prime\\)</span>。相对移动标记构造将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tot}^A\\in\\Pi_2^A\\subseteq\\Sigma_3^A\">\\(\\mathrm{Tot}^A\\in\\Pi_2^A\\subseteq\\Sigma_3^A\\)</span> 单射归约到二值部分程序的全延伸指标：肯定分支有二值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算延伸，否定分支没有任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算全延伸。若矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathrm{Tot}^A\">\\(e\\in\\mathrm{Tot}^A\\)</span> 等价于“存在一行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_i\">\\(f_i\\)</span>，对全部有限停止见证都与该部分程序相符”。这是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2^{0\\prime}\">\\(\\Sigma_2^{0\\prime}\\)</span> 条件（矩阵及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的阶段计算均 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\)</span> 可判定）。另一方面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tot}^A\\in\\Pi_2^A\\subseteq\\Pi_2^{0\\prime}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tot}^A\\in\\Pi_2^A\\subseteq\\Pi_2^{0\\prime}\\)</span>，所以相对 Post 定理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tot}^A\\le_T0\\prime\\prime\">\\(\\mathrm{Tot}^A\\le_T0\\prime\\prime\\)</span>。由相对 Tot 完全性得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\prime\\prime\\equiv_T0\\prime\\prime\">\\(A\\prime\\prime\\equiv_T0\\prime\\prime\\)</span>。该证明无需从任意二值行盲目搜索全函数编码的终止位置。</p>\n<p>来源：Proposition 4.9.4（以相对 Ext 完全性补足反向）；印刷页 103；PDF 第 139 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n<p>续修说明：反向归约直接使用移动标记引理的更强性质：肯定分支有二值全延伸，否定分支连任意自然数值全延伸也没有。Ext 的一般完全性陈述本身不足以保证肯定延伸可由二值矩阵覆盖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-low2-uniform-property","status":"resolved","id":"bd644b6a31616fc0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low2-uniform-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-low2-uniform-functions","status":"resolved","id":"47dda3af2234de34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-low2-uniform-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-ext-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"1028296e1af7c37c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-ext-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-tot-complete","status":"resolved","id":"3c8c6546a7f5a867","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-tot-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rel-post","status":"resolved","id":"7315f2111b653872","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-rel-post]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal","status":"resolved","id":"d9aaf109dea18156","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low2-uniform-property","status":"resol